      "en": "When we had departed from them and had set sail, we came with a straight course to Cos, and the next day to Rhodes, and from there to Patara.",
      "ko": "우리가 저희를 작별하고 행선하여 바로 고스로 가서 이튿날 로도에 이르러 거기서부터 바다라로 가서",
      "source_text_hash": "9a8b911b9908faa5914e24c7a79ed63a5d471a5c8329ede58b0d470e21c75d1d",
      "translation_text_hash": "32d416f5820ee42e35ae3e0c0609ab2bc582c015333b75c14260d7c40f6ab8e8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
