      "en": "When we had come in sight of Cyprus, leaving it on the left hand, we sailed to Syria and landed at Tyre, for the ship was there to unload her cargo.",
      "ko": "구브로를 바라보고 이를 왼편에 두고 수리아로 행선하여 두로에서 상륙하니 거기서 배가 짐을 풀려 함이러라",
      "source_text_hash": "745528fc45f0eff6fc8b8553bd692ba361ae962288beb7342bafe3b3470129a9",
      "translation_text_hash": "805ead4c52adc7ca1d0a9c62d9a79bbd00274ebc4b4521cc65fb1e499d18c463",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
