      "en": "After saying goodbye to each other, we went on board the ship, and they returned home again.",
      "ko": "서로 작별한 후 우리는 배에 오르고 저희는 집으로 돌아가니라",
      "source_text_hash": "5e5a63fd56cd5f691b4ae3122a5faa3c34d43748cc662f6dc2aa97c6c6e42c8b",
      "translation_text_hash": "014d7b1a3bcc2ae730d522e5ad00d94366c891b2d8d295e859a9ac2e7378c6fb",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
