      "en": "When we had finished the voyage from Tyre, we arrived at Ptolemais. We greeted the brothers and stayed with them one day.",
      "ko": "두로로부터 수로를 다 행하여 돌레마이에 이르러 형제들에게 안부를 묻고 그들과 함께 하루를 있다가",
      "source_text_hash": "6b8f146a283489196bdc50e3351f8464f617c76881ba60c443f2d8ce76608248",
      "translation_text_hash": "d634c6ecabc62262b075a26118b211adc6b0b422a1a9790bed93cd443f609264",
