      "en": "Now this man had four virgin daughters who prophesied.",
      "ko": "그에게 딸 넷이 있으니 처녀로 예언하는 자라",
      "source_text_hash": "587d950bdf953140a64548562f55a5a4d0b63f6734c1a233e046c38accb07029",
