      "en": "When we had come to Jerusalem, the brothers received us gladly.",
      "ko": "예루살렘에 이르니 형제들이 우리를 기꺼이 영접하거늘",
      "source_text_hash": "de0aa311e2ac7c665e3f8b4613e4943fcbc9b3a9d5476e6f7b4408f5a2477051",
      "translation_text_hash": "1e830bc82aef1fa87bdae9f8f56a422fe6adaab1a448ffbbe2c0d3e53f5a46fa",
