      "en": "All the city was moved and the people ran together. They seized Paul and dragged him out of the temple. Immediately the doors were shut.",
      "ko": "온 성이 소동하여 백성이 달려와 모여 바울을 잡아 성전 밖으로 끌고 나가니 문들이 곧 닫히더라",
      "source_text_hash": "f4758a011d9ba995b99b44be8ae5f0b8084637c7b62ee65c282ba4d2a76116c6",
      "translation_text_hash": "e626515c5ced507607df7df119798245a66d865ba2e072a1e1d4da39eb5b6dd1",
