      "en": "As they were trying to kill him, news came up to the commanding officer of the regiment that all Jerusalem was in an uproar.",
      "ko": "저희가 그를 죽이려 할 때에 온 예루살렘의 요란하다는 소문이 군대의 천부장에게 들리매",
      "source_text_hash": "7398d273ffcb74687c88bdd1ea09a1e681b0734d96f578017c1d9cb9b55b5a2a",
      "translation_text_hash": "95d33b08d28e0fb7ba3ea9277d5a1c02456c375d8f24a0da319183c9e91c2d9f",
