      "en": "Immediately he took soldiers and centurions and ran down to them. They, when they saw the chief captain and the soldiers, stopped beating Paul.",
      "ko": "저가 급히 군사들과 백부장들을 거느리고 달려 내려가니 저희가 천부장과 군사들을 보고 바울 치기를 그치는지라",
      "source_text_hash": "c682feb1c7fce046be0919d08e52f4c832c07b68097c01cc24428da6ed60f27d",
      "translation_text_hash": "26e3e01b9fe030b30121bf572200b72fed552c44d783cef5485c742831d20f81",
