      "en": "Then the commanding officer came near, arrested him, commanded him to be bound with two chains, and inquired who he was and what he had done.",
      "ko": "이에 천부장이 가까이 가서 바울을 잡아 두 쇠사슬로 결박하라 명하고 누구며 무슨 일을 하였느냐 물으니",
      "source_text_hash": "ab5948ff8ceb5667544c0c3f32c113093504916f91d4b5c6668491b54fbedbb9",
      "translation_text_hash": "f60ef836b537e600423549903ee15f0d2079b88d3c826fce1ce70f4400add326",
