      "en": "When he came to the stairs, he was carried by the soldiers because of the violence of the crowd;",
      "ko": "바울이 층대에 이를 때에 무리의 포행을 인하여 군사들에게 들려가니",
      "source_text_hash": "86205faa2e5e1a78191f06afd5dd072c23387e1bc4129104a669c213bcd1ce78",
      "translation_text_hash": "2b20ff686d1d525a631f09627e8681b5ea4333ea119492bf365668059b42f0a0",
